(\"StyleBoxFlat_amlv4\")\nCheckButton/styles/normal = SubResource(\"StyleBoxFlat_j2q5q\")\n```\nThe same theme resource when using drag&drop:\n```\n[resource]\nCheckButton/styles/hover = SubResource(\"StyleBoxFlat_j2q5q\")\nCheckButton/styles/normal = SubResource(\"StyleBoxFlat_j2q5q\")\n```\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nContext menu:\n1. Make a new UI theme\n2. Open the theme editor\n3. Add override for CheckButton\n4. Make a StyleBox for `normal` state\n5. Copy the `normal` state StyleBox using RMB -> Copy and then paste it into any other state\n6. Change some styles in the `normal` state. The copy of the resource will not change accordingly\n\nD&D:\n5. Drag and drop the `normal` state StyleBox into another state\n6. Change some styles in the `normal` state StyleBox. Both resources will change accordingly\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[workspace.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20762018/workspace.zip)\n\nA video showing the problem:\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d0a4c422-8b15-417b-bc5d-1c3f6c46414d","closed_by":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/receiv